OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA scattering
OL,6,Fof showers persisting this evening and
OL,7,Fovernight, locally heavy by dawn
OL,8,Facross Cumbria. Cold again with a
OL,9,Fpatchy frost under any clear spells
OL,10,Fand a breeze picking up.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSaturday:FChilly to start the weekend
OL,13,Fwith showery outbreaks of rain along
OL,14,Fthe western coast of Cumbria.
OL,15,FGenerally, more cloudy but mostly dry
OL,16,Fin the south. Winds strengthening into
OL,17,Fthe afternoon.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
