OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FBecoming
OL,6,Fmore changeable through the period
OL,7,Fwith spells of rain, showers and
OL,8,Fstronger winds, interspersed by drier
OL,9,Fand brighter interludes. Temperatures
OL,10,Falso recovering closer to average.
